WEBVTT

00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:32.116
most people my age were not asking.

00:03:32.156 --> 00:03:33.996
Why is this happening,

00:03:33.996 --> 00:03:36.516
or who is to blame, and what is to blame?

00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:38.596
Is there anything we can do to stop it?

00:03:38.596 --> 00:03:40.756
To stop the interruptions
to our schooling,

00:03:40.796 --> 00:03:42.036
to our livelihoods,

00:03:42.036 --> 00:03:44.396
to stop the fear we have for the future.

00:03:45.156 --> 00:03:48.476
Since I was 10, I started
to recognize all these changes.

00:03:48.516 --> 00:03:51.916
I became passionate about climate change
and the environment.

00:03:52.356 --> 00:03:54.436
I joined environmental club
since grade five

00:03:54.436 --> 00:03:58.676
and I'm currently the president
of the environmental club at my school,

00:03:58.716 --> 00:04:00.436
Inyathi High School.